@QuestionsAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5213
@ClientId = client1
@ClientSecret = secret1

### 1. Get OAuth2 Token (Client Credentials Flow)
POST {{QuestionsAPI_HostAddress}}/oauth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientId": "{{ClientId}}",
  "clientSecret": "{{ClientSecret}}",
  "grantType": "client_credentials"
}

###

### 2. Get Questions with Authorization (Bearer Token)
### Use the token from the above request and paste it here as @Token
@Token = paste_token_from_step_1_here

GET {{QuestionsAPI_HostAddress}}/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Get Questions WITHOUT Token (Should fail with 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{QuestionsAPI_HostAddress}}/questions

###
